Hi Andy,

I see what the problem is now; instead of having explicit library calls for each package, I did the following, which does not seem to be recognised by deployApp():
toLoad <- c("shinyIncubator", "gglplot2", "plyr")
lapply(toLoad, library, character.only = TRUE)

So that's fixed, but ran into other errors but should probably start a new topic for that. Thanks for the help!

- Jin Rou

